# Keylayout for dedicated side / PTT node (mtk-kpd).
# Volume + Power stay. Scans 249/250 are Titan side buttons — MUST NOT map
# to CAMERA (or APP_SWITCH/HOME). Unmapped → InputReader drops; pad-agent
# owns short/long via getevent / titan2-side-watch (B1).
key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
key 116   POWER
# key 249 intentionally omitted (side · top)
# key 250 intentionally omitted (side · bottom)
